{
  "_comment": "Multi-reference character keyframe generation (Qwen-Image-Edit 2511). THE character-replacement workhorse the studio was missing: every prior keyframe path was either pure text-to-image (scene_compose_zimage_*) or single-ref inpaint (qwen_edit_inpaint*), which is why cast identity drifted and why inserting a specific sibling kept failing. Feeds up to 3 locked references into TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus: image1=character (cast.yaml ref_set.front), image2=wardrobe/pendant enforcement crop (ref_set.pendant), image3=location plate. Identity and wardrobe ride in on REFERENCES; the prompt carries ACTION and CAMERA only, per cdx-cast-lock Phase 3.",
  "1": {"class_type": "LoadImage", "inputs": {"image": "{{CHARACTER_REF}}"}, "_meta": {"title": "image1 - locked character ref"}},
  "2": {"class_type": "LoadImage", "inputs": {"image": "{{PENDANT_REF}}"}, "_meta": {"title": "image2 - wardrobe/pendant enforcement crop"}},
  "3": {"class_type": "LoadImage", "inputs": {"image": "{{PLATE_REF}}"}, "_meta": {"title": "image3 - location plate"}},
  "4": {"class_type": "UNETLoader", "inputs": {"unet_name": "qwen_image_edit_2511_fp8mixed.safetensors", "weight_dtype": "default"}},
  "5": {"class_type": "CLIPLoader", "inputs": {"clip_name": "qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "type": "qwen_image", "device": "default"}},
  "6": {"class_type": "VAELoader", "inputs": {"vae_name": "qwen_image_vae.safetensors"}},
  "7": {"class_type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus", "inputs": {"clip": ["5", 0], "prompt": "{{PROMPT}}", "vae": ["6", 0], "image1": ["1", 0], "image2": ["2", 0], "image3": ["3", 0]}},
  "8": {"class_type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus", "inputs": {"clip": ["5", 0], "prompt": "{{NEGATIVE}}", "vae": ["6", 0], "image1": ["1", 0]}},
  "9": {"class_type": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "inputs": {"width": "{{WIDTH}}", "height": "{{HEIGHT}}", "batch_size": 1}},
  "10": {"class_type": "KSampler", "inputs": {"model": ["4", 0], "positive": ["7", 0], "negative": ["8", 0], "latent_image": ["9", 0], "seed": "{{SEED}}", "steps": 20, "cfg": 2.5, "sampler_name": "euler", "scheduler": "simple", "denoise": 1.0}},
  "11": {"class_type": "VAEDecode", "inputs": {"samples": ["10", 0], "vae": ["6", 0]}},
  "12": {"class_type": "SaveImage", "inputs": {"images": ["11", 0], "filename_prefix": "{{PREFIX}}"}}
}
